IMPORT `bm-ear-period`

-- Bao Minh erection all risks rules: the preamble (src:5-13) and the general conditions
-- 1-9 (src:60-150), pages 1-3.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated by tools/vnsrc.py from line N of
-- ../../source/raw/baominh-ear.txt.
--
-- WHAT THIS PART DOES. The preamble makes the questionnaire and proposal form part of the
-- policy and conditions Bao Minh's promise on the premium. General Condition 1 then makes
-- compliance with EVERYTHING the Insured must do, and the answers in the questionnaire and
-- proposal form, a condition precedent to Bao Minh's liability. Conditions 3-6 are the
-- duties it reaches; 5 adds a 14-day notice bar; 7 is arbitration of the amount; 8 forfeits
-- all benefit for fraud and bars a claim not sued on within three months of an award; 9 is
-- contribution with other insurance.
--
-- THE DUTIES AS FACTS. A claim records the duties the Insured did not comply with (a list
-- of `A duty of the Insured`). Each condition below names the duties it imposes, so a reader
-- can find each one under its own number; General Condition 1 reads the list. Duties with a
-- deadline or a sequence are ALSO written as regulative rules in bm-ear-duties.l4, which a
-- trace exercises; a trace's outcome cannot flow back into these rules, which is why the
-- claim file records compliance as a fact.

§ `Preamble`

-- "On the basis that the Insured named in the attached schedule has sent Bao Minh a
-- proposal form by completing the questionnaire (this questionnaire, together with the
-- Insured's other declarations relating to this Policy, is a constituent part of this
-- Policy," [the parenthesis is never closed in the source].
