§§ `General Condition 2 — the schedule is part of the policy`

-- "The schedule and the following parts form part of the policy, and 'this Policy'
-- includes them wherever it is used. Any word or expression to which a meaning has been
-- attached in any part of this Policy, in the schedule or in the following parts, bears
-- that meaning wherever it appears."
--
-- INERT. Nothing here decides a case: the first sentence is why the schedule's figures are
-- inputs to every rule, and the second points to defined meanings that the document never
-- gives. Apart from the short name "Bảo Minh" (src:6), the document defines no word at all
-- (Finding 12).
