§§ `General Condition 5 — claims`

-- "On the happening of an occurrence that may give rise to a claim under this Policy, the
-- Insured must: (a) notify Bao Minh immediately by telephone or telegram as well as in
-- writing, stating the nature and extent of the loss; (b) take all measures within its
-- power to minimise the loss; (c) preserve the damaged parts and make them available for
-- inspection by Bao Minh's representative or surveyor; (d) provide all information and
-- documents Bao Minh requires; (e) inform the police in case of loss by theft."
