-- src:145 | Trọng tài chung đưa ra phán quyết, trường hợp đưa ra trọng tài như quy định ở trên thì tất cả
-- src:146 | các quyền lợi theo đơn bảo hiểm này sẽ không có trị giá.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, General Condition 8, three-month bar (src:143-146)
GIVEN `the day of the award` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`General Condition 8: the last day to commence proceedings after an award made on` `the day of the award` MEANS
    `add months` `the day of the award` 3

@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, General Condition 8, three-month bar (src:143-146)
GIVEN `the claim`        IS A `A claim`
      `the day of the award` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`no proceedings on` `the claim` `were commenced within three months of an award made on` `the day of the award` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the claim`'s `the dispute`'s `date proceedings were commenced`
    WHEN JUST p  THEN p GREATER THAN `the last day`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the claim`'s `the date of assessment` GREATER THAN `the last day`
    WHERE `the last day` MEANS `General Condition 8: the last day to commence proceedings after an award made on` `the day of the award`

@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, General Condition 8, three-month bar (src:143-146)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`General Condition 8: the rejected claim is barred` `the claim` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the claim`'s `the dispute`'s `date of the arbitral award`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST a  THEN     `the claim`'s `the dispute`'s `rejected`
                      AND `no proceedings on` `the claim` `were commenced within three months of an award made on` a

§§ `General Condition 9 — other insurance`

-- "If, when a claim arises under this Policy, any other policy also insures that physical
-- loss or liability, Bao Minh will not pay more than its proportion of the claim for that
-- loss or liability." The document does not say how the proportion is computed (fork F20);
-- where it has not been agreed or determined, the rule refuses rather than invent a basis.
-- src:148 | 9. Nếu vào thời điểm phát sinh khiếu nại theo Đơn bảo hiểm này mà có bất kỳ một Đơn bảo
