@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, General Condition 9 (src:148-150)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`General Condition 9 does not say how Bao Minh's proportion is computed, and none has been agreed or determined` MEANS
    REFUSE "General Condition 9 does not say how Bao Minh's proportion is computed, and none has been agreed or determined"

@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, General Condition 9 (src:148-150)
GIVEN `the claim`  IS A `A claim`
      `the amount` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`General Condition 9: Bao Minh's share, in` `the claim` `, of` `the amount` MEANS
    IF   NOT `the claim`'s `other insurance covers the same loss or liability`
    THEN `the amount`
    ELSE CONSIDER `the claim`'s `Bao Minh's ratable proportion, as determined`
         WHEN JUST p  THEN `the amount` TIMES p
         WHEN NOTHING THEN `General Condition 9 does not say how Bao Minh's proportion is computed, and none has been agreed or determined`

§ `The grounds that defeat a whole claim`

-- The grounds that reach every loss and every liability in a claim, in document order:
-- the preamble's premium condition, the general exclusions, General Condition 1 (its duty
-- limb, then its questionnaire limb, read under reading (ii)), the 14-day bar of General
-- Condition 5, and General Condition 8. A refusal in an earlier ground stops the list.
@ref Bao Minh EAR rules, preamble (src:10-13); general exclusions (src:18-32); General Conditions 1, 5 and 8
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A ground on which Bao Minh is not liable`
`the grounds that defeat the whole of` `the claim` MEANS
    concat (LIST
        (IF `the premium condition in the preamble is met for` (`the claim`'s `the policy`)
         THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST `preamble: the premium stated in the schedule has not been paid`),
        `the general exclusions that apply to` (`the claim`'s `the occurrence`),
        `General Condition 1: the duties breached in` (`the claim`'s `the conduct of the Insured`),
        (IF   `under` `the reading of General Condition 1 taken here` `, General Condition 1 is met by` (`the answers that form part of` (`the claim`'s `the policy`))
         THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST `GC1: the questionnaire and proposal form were not answered truly and completely`),
        (IF `General Condition 5: Bao Minh received notice in time of` `the claim`
         THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST `GC5: Bao Minh received no notice within 14 days of the occurrence`),
        (IF `General Condition 8: all benefit is forfeited for` (`the claim`'s `the conduct of the Insured`)
         THEN LIST `GC8: all benefit is forfeited for fraud or a false declaration` ELSE EMPTY),
        (IF `General Condition 8: the rejected claim is barred` `the claim`
         THEN LIST `GC8: no proceedings were commenced within three months of the award` ELSE EMPTY))
